    "details": "The Keycloak Team reports:\n\n> - \\[CVE-2026-12388\\]: IdP mapper admin role escalation.\n> - \\[CVE-2026-14781\\]: OIDC broker applies id_token email_verified to\n>   userinfo email, marking unverified addresses as verified.\n> - \\[CVE-2026-19608\\]: Name-only group claims let same-name groups\n>   satisfy path-specific group policies.\n> - \\[CVE-2026-54515\\], \\[CVE-2026-59889\\]: Third-party dependency fix,\n>   com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind 2.22.0.\n> - \\[CVE-2026-59903\\]: Third-party dependency fix,\n>   io.netty:netty-codec-http:4.1.136.Final.\n",
